# Push updates

When the user updates code in this project, push that same latest state. Do not wait to be asked again.

- Commit the latest valid work on `main` and push to `origin` (`charchilfromlink2build/L2B-Vendor-Appium-Automation`).
- Update the live GitHub Pages dashboard (index, bugs, coverage) so the public site matches the repo.
- Keep the published Allure report. Do not delete Allure history. If a full `gh-pages` push fails because the report is too large, update only the changed dashboard files and leave Allure in place.
- Do not restore older dashboard HTML or older commits over newer files.
- Dashboard test-case total must stay aligned with the published Allure report total.
